; DISPATCHER: "wasm" keyword.  The release binary is built with default features
; ["grounding","specialize_io"] (kernel/Cargo.toml:32) -- NO wasm -- so ASink::new
; reaches the wasm arm and panics at CONSTRUCTION time (sinks.rs:1295), i.e. BEFORE the
; query runs, even for zero matches.
(foo 1)
(exec 0 (, (foo $a)) (O (wasm (nop) (w $a))))
